==================================================
```

## TEST CASE 1c
This test should be run with .py and .txt listed as command-line arguments.

This test is similar to **TEST CASE 1b**, but the functionality is now being tested with multiple
command-line arguments.

A successful result should list the entire directory structure, but only display text from
files ending in .py and .txt across all subdirectories.

